WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.379
Start with a dark horizon and one warm source.

00:00:03.379 --> 00:00:08.889
The lamp gives the viewer a place to look before the tower becomes visible.

00:00:08.889 --> 00:00:13.517
Add a reflected path to connect that light with the foreground.

00:00:13.517 --> 00:00:18.072
In the second composition, the window becomes the focal point.

00:00:18.072 --> 00:00:23.508
In the final view, reduce the contrast to make the same place feel calmer.

00:00:23.508 --> 00:00:28.210
These are original composition boards rather than film excerpts.

